The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution as a membership fee.
[[cite:obs-7087a17630d8ebfee6246f3c56e6113c22a2aa81 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The exact amount a member pays each year is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.
[[cite:obs-f3e97ebc8b6d7e28f301af14afc905e0caf8351d "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]